Package: ragentledger
Type: Package
Title: Portable Provenance Receipts for AI-Assisted R Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jakob", "Hedrich", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prototype R-native JSONL provenance receipts for model and tool
    calls in AI-assisted R workflows. Records are hash-linked so edits,
    insertions, and reordering can be detected. This prototype is intentionally
    small and does not claim cryptographic signing or proof of external truth.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    digest,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
